{
  "slug": "laravel-api-tool-kit",
  "name": "Laravel Api Tool Kit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Production-grade rules and workflows for Laravel REST APIs built with essa/api-tool-kit. Teaches your AI assistant the\nexact patterns used in the package — so every controller, resource, action, filter, enum, and test it generates matches\nyour architecture from the first draft.\n\nIncludes 21 rule files covering models, controllers, requests, resources, actions, DTOs, filters, enums, repositories,\nevents, authorization, testing, database transactions, DDD structure, and anti-patterns.\n\nIncludes 8 guided workflows: build a full CRUD endpoint step by step, add filtering to an existing model, run a\ndefense-oriented code review, debug issues with data before code, test endpoints with curl and cross-reference against\nthe DB, and manage a per-project knowledge base.\n\nSupports both standard Laravel structure and Domain-Driven Design. Installs in one command: php artisan\napi-skill:install  Production-grade rules and workflows for Laravel REST APIs built with essa/api-tool-kit. Teaches your AI assistant the\nexact patterns used in the package — so every controller, resource, action, filter, enum, and test it generates matches\nyour architecture from the first draft.\n\nIncludes 21 rule files covering models, controllers, requests, resources, actions, DTOs, filters, enums, repositories,\nevents, authorization, testing, database transactions, DDD structure, and anti-patterns.\n\nIncludes 8 guided workflows: build a full CRUD endpoint step by step, add filtering to an existing model, run a\ndefense-oriented code review, debug issues with data before code, test endpoints with curl and cross-reference against\nthe DB, and manage a per-project knowledge base.\n\nSupports both standard Laravel structure and Domain-Driven Design. Installs in one command: php artisan\napi-skill:install",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `laravel-api-tool-kit` (Build production-grade Laravel REST APIs).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install laravel-api-tool-kit@claude-community` from `ahmedesa/laravel-api-tool-kit`.\n\nProduction-grade rules and workflows for Laravel REST APIs built with essa/api-tool-kit. Teaches your AI assistant the\nexact patterns used in the package — so every controller, resource, action, filter, enum, and test it generates matches\nyour architecture from the first draft.\n\nIncludes 21 rule files covering models, controllers, requests, resources, actions, DTOs, filters, enums, repositories,\nevents, authorization, testing, database transactions, DDD structure, and anti-patterns.\n\nIncludes 8 guided workflows: build a full CRUD endpoint step by step, add filtering to an existing model, run a\ndefense-oriented code review, debug issues with data before code, test endpoints with curl and cross-reference against\nthe DB, and manage a per-project knowledge base.\n\nSupports both standard Laravel structure and Domain-Driven Design. Installs in one command: php artisan\napi-skill:install  Production-grade rules and workflows for Laravel REST APIs built with essa/api-tool-kit. Teaches your AI assistant the\nexact patterns used in the package — so every controller, resource, action, filter, enum, and test it generates matches\nyour architecture from the first draft.\n\nIncludes 21 rule files covering models, controllers, requests, resources, actions, DTOs, filters, enums, repositories,\nevents, authorization, testing, database transactions, DDD structure, and anti-patterns.\n\nIncludes 8 guided workflows: build a full CRUD endpoint step by step, add filtering to an existing model, run a\ndefense-oriented code review, debug issues with data before code, test endpoints with curl and cross-reference against\nthe DB, and manage a per-project knowledge base.\n\nSupports both standard Laravel structure and Domain-Driven Design. Installs in one command: php artisan\napi-skill:install",
